msgstr "{0} 的視窗會從下一個開啟的視窗起套用新設定。"

msgid "Resizable"
msgstr "可調整大小"

msgid "Whether you can resize and maximize this app's windows. Off keeps each window at the size it opens at."
msgstr "是否可以調整此應用程式視窗的大小或將其最大化。關閉時，每個視窗都會維持開啟時的大小。"

msgid "Start below the title bar"
msgstr "從標題列下方開始"

msgid "For apps whose top bar is squeezed or hidden under the title bar.\nThe app starts below the title bar instead of drawing behind it.\nApplies the next time the app's window opens."
msgstr "適用於頂端列被標題列擠壓或遮住的應用程式。\n應用程式會從標題列下方開始顯示，而不是繪製在標題列後方。\n下次開啟該應用程式的視窗時生效。"

msgid "Window size when it opens"
msgstr "開啟時的視窗大小"

msgid "The size this app's windows open at"
msgstr "此應用程式視窗開啟時的大小"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "解除安裝"

msgid "This app is part of Android and cannot be uninstalled."
msgstr "此應用程式是 Android 的一部分，無法解除安裝。"

msgid "Uninstall {0}?"
msgstr "要解除安裝 {0} 嗎？"

msgid "{0} and its data will be removed from Android. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "{0} 及其資料將從 Android 中移除。此動作無法復原。"

msgid "{0} is uninstalled."
msgstr "已解除安裝 {0}。"

msgid "Not uninstalled"
msgstr "未解除安裝"

msgid "{0} was not uninstalled: {1} ({2})"
msgstr "未能解除安裝 {0}：{1}（{2}）"

msgid "These Android apps keep running after their windows close, to play music, download files, keep a VPN on or do other work.\nEach also has an indicator in the top bar.\nStopping an app ends what it is doing and frees the memory it used."
msgstr "這些 Android 應用程式會在視窗關閉後繼續執行，以播放音樂、下載檔案、保持 VPN 連線或進行其他工作。\n每個應用程式在頂端列也有一個指示器。\n停止應用程式會結束它正在做的事，並釋放它使用的記憶體。"

msgid "Stopping apps"
msgstr "停止應用程式"

msgid "Ask before stopping an app from its indicator"
msgstr "從指示器停止應用程式前先詢問"

msgid "Turn this back on if you chose not to be asked again."
msgstr "如果您先前選擇不再詢問，可在此重新開啟。"

msgid "The setting was not changed"
msgstr "設定未變更"

