msgstr "已停止 {0}。"

msgid "On your desktop"
msgstr "在您的桌面上"

msgid "Place the widgets your Android apps offer on your desktop. Each widget gets a window of its own, below your other windows.\nPress and hold a widget to edit it: drag it to move it, and drag its handles to resize it.\nRight-click a widget for its settings, its sizes and Remove. Android starts when you open this page."
msgstr "將 Android 應用程式提供的小工具放到桌面上。每個小工具都有自己的視窗，位於其他視窗下方。\n按住小工具即可編輯：拖曳可移動，拖曳控點可調整大小。\n在小工具上按右鍵，可開啟其設定、大小與「移除」。開啟此頁面時，Android 會啟動。"

msgid "Widgets your apps offer"
msgstr "應用程式提供的小工具"

msgid "Widgets could not be read or changed"
msgstr "無法讀取或變更小工具"

msgid "No widget is on your desktop yet."
msgstr "您的桌面上還沒有小工具。"

msgid "No app in Android offers a widget."
msgstr "Android 中沒有提供小工具的應用程式。"

msgid "At {0}, {1}, {2} × {3}"
msgstr "位於 {0}, {1}，{2} × {3}"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgid "{0} was removed from your desktop."
msgstr "已從桌面移除 {0}。"

msgid "asks you to set it up"
msgstr "會要求您進行設定"

msgid "Add to desktop"
msgstr "新增到桌面"

msgid "{0} is on your desktop."
msgstr "{0} 已在您的桌面上。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "The folder could not be opened"
msgstr "無法開啟資料夾"

msgid "{0} does not exist yet, or you may not open it."
msgstr "{0} 尚不存在，或您沒有開啟它的權限。"

msgid "Android sends its log only while this page is open, and nothing is written to disk.\nSave diagnostics gathers what a problem report needs into one zip file."
msgstr "只有在此頁面開啟時，Android 才會傳送記錄，且不會寫入磁碟。\n「儲存診斷資訊」會將問題回報所需的內容收集到一個 zip 檔案中。"

msgid "Filter by tag or text"
msgstr "依標籤或文字篩選"

msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暫停"

msgid "Save diagnostics"
msgstr "儲存診斷資訊"

msgid "The log cannot be read"
msgstr "無法讀取記錄"

msgid "Gathering the diagnostics. This takes a minute or more."
msgstr "正在收集診斷資訊。這需要一分鐘以上。"

msgid "Saved the diagnostics to {0}."
msgstr "已將診斷資訊儲存到 {0}。"

msgid "DSA Settings"
msgstr "DSA 設定"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"

msgid "Only APK files and split APK bundles can be installed: {0}"
msgstr "只能安裝 APK 檔案與分割 APK 組合包：{0}"

msgid "Installing {0} in Android…"
msgstr "正在將 {0} 安裝到 Android…"

msgid "{0} is installed ({1}). Open it from the app grid."
msgstr "已安裝 {0}（{1}）。可從應用程式清單開啟。"

msgid "{0} was not installed: {1} ({2})"
msgstr "未能安裝 {0}：{1}（{2}）"

msgid "{0} did not reach Android. {1}"
msgstr "{0} 未傳送到 Android。{1}"

msgid "State"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Desktop Subsystem for Android™ runs Android in its own lightweight virtual machine and shows each app in its own window."
msgstr "Desktop Subsystem for Android™ 在專屬的輕量虛擬機器中執行 Android，並將每個應用程式顯示在各自的視窗中。"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

